{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your backpack to the battlefield and annihilate foes of the forest. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Packmates, the secret to becoming an unstoppable force lies within your inventory.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically arrange gear to elevate your build and conquer waves of enemies with endearing animal heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/35788dcd9156ccdbf034edca7840afc7.avif?t=1771471354\" width=600 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/d050d748e8aa34192f6691ef2e33841c.poster.avif?t=1771471354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/d050d748e8aa34192f6691ef2e33841c.webm?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/d050d748e8aa34192f6691ef2e33841c.mp4?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf92 Optimize your inventory, elevate your build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Build item synergies to enhance every run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Collaborate in co-op, share loot, and grow stronger as a pack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcaa Collect and trade an array of inventory items for endless powerful combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/c8396597f113707ea031927b640af08d.avif?t=1771471354\" width=600 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/c4e05f7620536e282b980fef0ab38f27.poster.avif?t=1771471354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/c4e05f7620536e282b980fef0ab38f27.webm?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/c4e05f7620536e282b980fef0ab38f27.mp4?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd13 Unlock the cast of charming animal heroes, each with unique playstyles to crush bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/e7318591bf0eaef76faab902428112e7.avif?t=1771471354\" width=600 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/2334a75fcccebeec69d3eea5e20c5de0.poster.avif?t=1771471354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/2334a75fcccebeec69d3eea5e20c5de0.webm?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171540/extras/2334a75fcccebeec69d3eea5e20c5de0.mp4?t=1771471354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Increase efficiency with each run and enjoy satisfying combat by decimating  opponents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc5 Smash record